  "ruleCount": 18,
  "rules": [
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "d48449ed16ccd36307429291d7b02db455b99bbcd71918732be337ef5476f1ff",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-06-22T15:28:36.083Z",
      "risk": "low",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.data_truth.c0dc075e01f0",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "data_truth"
      ],
      "text": "这说明云端长期是“在老 commit 上手动改/运行”,不是正常部署。这个教训也要写进去,以后不论是你还是其他agent接手,都得规范化。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_61c9cce6cd274f3eff3c_d48449ed16ccd3630742"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "4357c22d22024954a344ac6a02816e92c4cef32d94d69615bafd9df95acb7258",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-06-26T03:55:00.000Z",
      "risk": "medium",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.execution.b8cf0ef375f1",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "execution"
      ],
      "text": "真实 SHEIN 写操作仍必须走 dry-run、人工确认、审计回读和按动作 payload 适配器,不能静默执行。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_1f1b7ffe12af0a645ce9_4357c22d22024954a344"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "5526b3bd11830addb3cdc7108a4f8e2d44b94c9f45e6009717c33cd74a8f1584",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-06-26T03:55:00.000Z",
      "risk": "high",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.execution.inventory.f479a6d27b4c",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "inventory",
        "execution"
      ],
      "text": "OpenAPI `stock-query` 是 SHEIN 虚拟库存证据,不能替代 ET 实际库存。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_2becbe3f926efd522d37_5526b3bd11830addb3cd"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "69245faaf968bcb469b566f6ae197b862fedefa0c8b0cb9048b738ef4d2a3250",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-06-26T06:40:00.000Z",
      "risk": "high",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.execution.inventory.publish.bbba4baccfd9",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "publish",
        "inventory",
        "execution"
      ],
      "text": "但 OpenAPI 商品状态只能稳定支持“是否已上架”二值对账,不能替代浏览器源四档 `待上架/已上架/已售罄/已下架`。OpenAPI 库存也是 SHEIN 虚拟库存证据,不能替代 ET 实际库存。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_0fc19ebf440072646330_69245faaf968bcb469b5"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "f1257218702db9c1ba93115bf94071ed1745bfa97f3e4549e54dd950f292baff",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-06-23T13:50:00.000Z",
      "risk": "high",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.execution.marketing.price.0e8ac882571e",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "price",
        "marketing",
        "execution"
      ],
      "text": "用户还明确:活动填报价里的固定整数价可以做几毛钱小数微调,例如 `160` 可填成 `159.57` 或 `160.28`,但不得越过平台价格上限、目标价底线、利润/成本安全线。预填/提交前必须检查目标执行文件中没有整数价",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_44c1428cab4174a0e105_f1257218702db9c1ba93"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "d0513587144b78154fe0195cfee46eaeccf282b3809bc7664a1c5f93f738d287",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-06-23T13:35:43.821Z",
      "risk": "high",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.execution.marketing.price.bc30bad71942",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "price",
        "marketing",
        "execution"
      ],
      "text": "后续每次生成/填报普通营销活动方案,都必须以上一次已经确认并执行的“最终版方案”为基准继承价格、利润率、曝光 Top5、归并和用户备注",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_5440185982d9865214f5_d0513587144b78154fe0"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "123b539e78ec5ab4bcf5a726be572ab1e35c5048bc47fea1d74bdd2aeec33322",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-06-23T13:35:43.821Z",
      "risk": "medium",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.execution.marketing.price.e5de2f852a57",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "price",
        "marketing",
        "execution"
      ],
      "text": "微调必须在平台最低降幅上限、目标价/利润安全线和普通活动不依赖优惠券保底的新规则内执行",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_cf8f7d79d0e301aa5bb1_123b539e78ec5ab4bcf5"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "5a08296de7b70644df5e3624301e937402f0b359f65ec36eb6dbca4ae72cd788",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-06-23T13:50:00.000Z",
      "risk": "medium",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.execution.marketing.price.product_identity.b798066e609c",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "product_identity",
        "price",
        "marketing",
        "execution"
      ],
      "text": "用户明确纠正:后续每次填报普通营销活动,都必须以上一次用户确认并真实执行/等待执行的最终版 `selection-plan + price-overrides` 作为基准,继承用户备注、固定价、特殊利润率、低价例外、货号归并和小数微调",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_b1ad29803979c9b62f2f_5a08296de7b70644df5e"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "083cda048b36c8d6ebef7355498bc87bad4b2799dcc32c5c5c29999a7260678c",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-06-26T03:55:00.000Z",
      "risk": "high",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.f3c7a00668f52e93",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [],
      "text": "敏感字段扫描不得出现 `[REDACTED OPAQUE TOKEN]`。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_b125e9c5388abc5f3502_083cda048b36c8d6ebef"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "36a9db6798055a2fca911d162c067c15d39990199bca6aa361505c563ec21801",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-07-12T08:30:22.147Z",
      "risk": "low",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.identity.9b38a2347364",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "identity"
      ],
      "text": "实施吧。但同事看到所谓当前使用负责人规则包 v2026...这种似乎没有什么意义。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_5ed529ee0fcb8623d808_36a9db6798055a2fca91"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "ccac4cf0f68f895682d9ff44b9a868b365f9d5c9e94bee68dba336347366e3cc",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-06-20T15:58:00.000Z",
      "risk": "high",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.inventory.product_identity.577370746ad7",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "product_identity",
        "inventory"
      ],
      "text": "不要再把 `ET发货单累计 < ET库存 + 历史销量` 写成“发货单缺采”,也不要用 `ET库存+历史销量` 反推供给下限。只能标为 `ET库存/销量匹配待核`,用于排查货号归并、销量或库存匹配问题。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_b30e7c067f5be1a074c6_ccac4cf0f68f895682d9"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "1cc13796fd3ecf19a0082ccc704d4a2846611175a24f5ad77ab256158d8bbd8e",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-06-23T13:50:00.000Z",
      "risk": "medium",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.price.publish.9d5ae7575076",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "publish",
        "price"
      ],
      "text": "不能从旧草稿、默认利润率或重新扫描后的默认策略从头重算。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_60ea8311c1cab1af6f78_1cc13796fd3ecf19a008"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "973e9b1caaae5d39419fb02ef67f92da8c55ab2a59cc43e45ef27850732fb6f7",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-06-26T03:55:00.000Z",
      "risk": "medium",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.publish.02a7cbc74d2c",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "publish"
      ],
      "text": "不要再按旧记忆把 OpenAPI 描述成 HL-only、待审核或默认关闭。旧 `[REDACTED OPAQUE TOKEN].sh` / Windows `scheduled_openapi_hl_*` 只作历史诊断入口。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_417e24896a18de43c272_973e9b1caaae5d39419f"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "d4986e4bd817ebaa5172aee9b7e2f223efede3ee13b190a47f0540d861fab53a",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-06-26T03:55:00.000Z",
      "risk": "medium",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.publish.11d4a2ba61a7",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "publish"
      ],
      "text": "商品/链接 OpenAPI 只能稳定对账“是否已上架”二值,不能替代浏览器源四档状态",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_876e86d7561e689e6c1c_d4986e4bd817ebaa5172"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "3b058e00696a7ec8417f695c841c9689e685d4a2c73d7497f4066bd547558266",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-06-23T13:35:43.821Z",
      "risk": "medium",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.publish.2360cef77236",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "publish"
      ],
      "text": "不得重新从默认策略或新扫描草稿直接起算。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_21737870807c1ff4471a_3b058e00696a7ec8417f"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "a5fb872a799a3374df029a8cf5ccbf3455f871be294119954d8dcb611ba6da3b",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": {
        "knowledgeAuthority": {
          "allowReverseOverwrite": false,
          "coworkerPersistence": "task_or_session_only",
          "publisher": "owner_only"
        }
      },
      "publishedAt": "2026-07-12T08:30:22.147Z",
      "risk": "low",
      "ruleKey": "authority.owner-one-way-knowledge",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "identity",
        "images",
        "ui"
      ],
      "text": "1、图片只是举例。我指的是所有经验。\n2、路径应该我的本机以及cli我的账号,以及我的BI账号沉淀下来的经验,需要同步到网页。而同事们操作的,就不能同步了。也就是说,我的经验一定会同步给他们,而他们的不能反向覆盖我的。\n3、因为我会更习惯用codex本地来干活,而同事们大概率会使用网页端。如何保证规则传递链路的自动和顺畅。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_c8773de02286b34b13cd_a5fb872a799a3374df02"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "123d724fefa7845a6928d09d961c4906220c485b1187fad46e9484ff9273ec7a",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": {
        "controlledWrite": {
          "allowSilentWrite": false,
          "requireAudit": true,
          "requireDryRun": true,
          "requireHumanConfirmation": true,
          "requireReadback": true
        }
      },
      "publishedAt": "2026-07-02T05:29:38.000Z",
      "risk": "high",
      "ruleKey": "execution.controlled-write-boundary",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "identity",
        "images",
        "publish",
        "execution"
      ],
      "text": "默认目标结构是轮播主图 1 张、细节图最多 11 张、方形图 1 张、SKU/色块图 1 张。AI 只能辅助判断图片内容、质量、重复和冲突,不得凭图片发明商品参数、认证或功能。真实提交前仍必须把素材转换成 SHEIN 可接受的图片 URL 和发布/`partialEdit` 字段,并走账号权限、资料检查、自然语言确认、审计和回读",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_2c4a07ad3290e56adeff_123d724fefa7845a6928"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "1aa3c2820332730352a4305c03ae653c21cf50cb96f8d6722d2bdfc9aa59c804",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": {
        "imageWorkflow": {
          "mode": "upload_suggest_adjust_controlled_submit",
          "requirePreview": true,
          "requireUrlConversion": true
        }
      },
      "publishedAt": "2026-07-02T05:29:38.000Z",
      "risk": "medium",
      "ruleKey": "images.role-ordering",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "images",
        "publish",
        "execution"
      ],
      "text": "BI V2 自动运营的上新/换图体验应是“上传图片 + AI 排序建议 + 自然语言调整 + 受控提交”,不要回退到让普通员工手写 SHEIN `partialEdit` 图片 JSON。用户上传图片后,系统可以根据内容判断轮播主图、细节图、方形图和 SKU/色块图顺序",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_f993f4fa0a15323f3710_1aa3c2820332730352a4"
    }
  ],
